METHODS / TECHNIQUES (cited, no code vendored)
----------------------------------------------

* StreamingLLM (Xiao et al., 2024) — attention sink + sliding window.
* YaRN (Peng et al., 2023) and positional interpolation (Chen et al., 2023) —
  context-length extension applied to the Qwen checkpoints.
* RULER (Hsieh et al., 2024) — long-context task families. src/gen_ruler.py is
  an independent, dependency-free RE-IMPLEMENTATION of the RULER task templates;
  it embeds no RULER data and carries no dataset license. Inputs are synthesized
  locally from a seeded generator.

